  and the engine in `except Exception: self.close(); raise` -- both clean up
  and re-raise ValueError AND RecursionError alike (no leak difference); the
  CLI catches neither. The ValueError-assuming "callers" are the suite's own
  tests (S-1/S-2 assertRaises) and external consumers following the parser's
  documentation. BLOCKER.md §3.1's "every caller in this repository" should be
  softened; the defect's substance is unaffected.

